, spec) (PyObject_Format)."] [579 1 "// Ascii is ascii(o): repr with the non-ASCII characters escaped."] [617 1 "// ---- t-strings ----"] [624 1 "// Template is string.templatelib.Template: its strings (one more than its interpolations)."] [632 1 "// Interpolation is string.templatelib.Interpolation."] [639 1 "// TemplateLib is string.templatelib's names (PY5e's import makes the module from them)."] [663 2 "// float's __format__ (PY5e, part 2b: PY5b's float came after PY5c's formatters)"] [756 2 "// Interpolation's class patterns (Objects/interpolationobject.c's __match_args__; PY6a)"] [799 5 "// _PyTemplate_Concat, Template's sq_concat"] [815 2 "// Objects/templateobject.c's template_new (queue 250): *args only, each a str or an Interpolation, adjacent strs"] [816 2 "// concatenated and an empty str between two interpolations and at either end"] [847 2 "// template_reduce: string.templatelib._template_unpickle with the strings and the interpolations"] [866 2 "// Objects/interpolationobject.c's interpolation_new (Argument Clinic's): value, expression='', conversion=None"] [867 2 "// (_conversion_converter: None or one of 's', 'a', 'r'), format_spec=''"] [898 2 "// interpolation_reduce: (type, (value, expression, conversion, format_spec))"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[188 20] [203 21] [203 29] [223 27] [223 34] [369 70] [379 40] [557 30] [648 23] [691 51] [824 27] [832 44] [849 39] [853 50] [875 27] [885 23] [891 27] [900 39]]} (go/file "format.go" :imports [


